sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI (backend/main.py)
    participant Routes as Routes (backend/api/*)
    participant Services as Services (model_service.py)
    participant Loader as Loader (model_pipeline_loader.py)
    participant MLflow as MLflow/DagsHub

    Client->>API: POST /predict (json, auth)
    API->>Routes: validate & parse request
    Routes->>Services: pass data
    Services->>Loader: load model (if not cached)
    Loader->>MLflow: fetch registered model
    Loader-->>Services: return model
    Services->>Services: preprocess input, predict
    Services-->>API: return prediction
    API-->>Client: JSON response (time, bounds)
